# API rules

Musts while editing `apps/api/**`. Detail/checklists: `knowledge/api-conventions.md`. Why: ADR-0004.

- Layering: route → schema → model. No business logic in `main.py`.
- Mount on `/api/v1` via `routes/__init__.py`. Plural resource prefixes.
- Schemas: `Create` / `Update` / `Read`. Delete → 204 empty body.
- 404 detail: `"<Resource> not found"`. Validation → Pydantic 422.
- Register new models in `models/__init__.py` for Alembic.
- Mirror `items` for CRUD. Non-CRUD / services → `api-patterns` skill.
- Auth → `api-auth` skill (never invent here).
- Structural work via stack skills (`add-api-endpoint`, `add-migration`, …).
